{% if deferred_tools %}
<DEFERRED_TOOLS>
<purpose>
Besides the tools you can call directly, the tools below can only be run
through `{{ call_tool }}`. Learn their parameters with `{{ search_tool }}`,
then run them with `{{ call_tool }}`.
</purpose>

<tools_through_call_tool>
{% for tool in deferred_tools %}
- `{{ tool.name }}`: {{ tool.description }}
{% endfor %}
</tools_through_call_tool>

<workflow>
1. Pick the tool from the list above that fits the task.
2. Call `{{ search_tool }}` with its exact name in `names` (several at
   once if you need more than one). When unsure which one fits, pass a
   `query` describing what you need instead. It returns each tool's
   parameters.
3. Call `{{ call_tool }}` with `tool` set to the exact name and
   `arguments` set to an object that matches those parameters.
</workflow>

<rules>
- Learn a tool's parameters with `{{ search_tool }}` before its first
  `{{ call_tool }}`; never guess them.
- Tools you already have are called directly, never through `{{ call_tool }}`.
- If `{{ call_tool }}` returns an error, fix the call as the message says
  and try again.
</rules>
</DEFERRED_TOOLS>
{% endif %}
